"To earn your badge for Quantum machine learning, take the exam at IBM&reg; "
"Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in "
"this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that "
"you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para obtener tu insignia de Quantum Machine Learning, realiza el examen en "
"IBM&reg; Training. Este examen está diseñado para realizarse después de "
"completar las lecciones de este curso. Después de aprobar el examen, Credly "
"te informará que has obtenido una insignia.\n"

